"archívum sérült."

#. translators: %s: the address two sites of the archive would share
#: includes/Multisite/BlogMap.php:243
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Two sites of the archive would get the same address on this network (%s), so "
"it cannot be restored here."
msgstr ""
"Az archívum két honlapja ugyanazt a címet kapná ezen a hálózaton (%s), ezért "
"ide nem állítható vissza."

#: includes/Multisite/ExportScope.php:53
msgid ""
"A network backup needs a table prefix of letters, digits and underscores "
