#. translators: 1: name of the connected site, 2: its address.
#: build/index.js:126
msgid ""
"Bring %1$s (%2$s) here? That site makes a backup, this site downloads and "
"restores it, replacing this site's content. You confirm the summary first."
msgstr ""
"Áthozod ide ezt az oldalt: %1$s (%2$s)? Az az oldal mentést készít, ez az "
